      "unit": "pattern name",
      "status": "candidate",
      "sources": [
        "3GPP-TR38901",
        "ITU-M2412"
      ],
      "justification": "3GPP TR 38.901 Table 7.3-1 sector element (65 degree beamwidth, 8 dBi peak, 30 dB front-to-back), the element ITU-R M.2412 also uses. It is TRACED by the ray tracer, so its gain is part of the path gain."
    },
