        "3GPP-TR38830"
      ],
      "justification": "Isotropic user antenna, matching the isotropic receiver of the ray-traced maps (0 dBi in TR 36.942 section 4.2.2, M.2412 at 4 GHz, TR 38.830 for FR1). M.2412 and TR 38.830 give 5 dBi at 30 GHz with user-side beamforming, left to the deployment interpretation."
    },
    "noise_figure_db": {
      "value": 9.0,
      "unit": "dB",
      "status": "candidate",
      "sources": [
