        "3GPP-TR36942",
        "ITU-M2292",
        "3GPP-TR38921"
      ],
      "justification": "9 dB user noise figure in the 3GPP 6G coverage assumptions (TR 38.914 Table 5.1.20.1-2), TR 36.942 Table 4.8, M.2292 Table 1 and the TR 38.921 baseline. Per-band values (7 dB at 4 GHz, 10 dB at 30 GHz in M.2412) belong to the deployment interpretation."
