      "status": "assumed",
      "basis": "NR band n78 (3300-3800 MHz, up to 100 MHz). The Iraqi regulator's plan names 3.4-3.8 GHz as the main 5G capacity band with 100 MHz blocks per licence holder, but no 5G spectrum had been assigned and no commercial 5G launched as of November 2026.",
