      "status": "candidate",
      "basis": "WRC-27 agenda item 1.7: in ITU Region 1 (which includes Iraq) 7.125-7.25 GHz and 7.75-8.4 GHz are under study for mobile use; the carrier occupies 7.8-8.2 GHz. 400 MHz is the maximum carrier bandwidth 3GPP agreed for the 7 GHz range in March 2026. Not identified for mobile use yet.",
