      "status": "candidate",
      "basis": "WRC-27 agenda item 1.7: 14.8-15.35 GHz is under study in all regions; the carrier occupies 14.8-15.2 GHz. 400 MHz is the bandwidth 3GPP assumes at 15 GHz for 6G evaluation; no carrier maximum has been agreed for this range. Used today in Iraq for fixed links and defence systems. Not identified for mobile use yet.",
